---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Welcome
description: You've entered Wagglesworth Estate. Find your way to stories, residents, the map, and the gallery.
permalink: /estate/
---
<h1>Welcome to the Estate</h1>
<p>
    You have made it past the gates. Wagglesworth Estate spreads out before you —
    stories, residents, gardens, and at least one room nobody has fully explained yet.
    Where would you like to go first?
</p>

{% set newest = collections.stories | firstWhereTrue("newestAdventure") %}
{% if newest %}
<section aria-labelledby="newest-adventure-heading" class="card" style="margin: var(--space-3) 0;">
    <h2 id="newest-adventure-heading">Newest Adventure</h2>
    <p><a href="{{ newest.url | url }}"><strong>{{ newest.data.title }}</strong></a></p>
    {% if newest.data.summary %}<p>{{ newest.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
</section>
{% endif %}

<nav aria-label="Explore the Estate">
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h2><a href="{{ '/stories/' | url }}">Stories</a></h2>
            <p>Every adventure, told in series and by category, in the order they happen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2><a href="{{ '/residents/' | url }}">Meet the Residents</a></h2>
            <p>The Baroness and her whole household, the Ladies-in-Waiting, and friends of the Estate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2><a href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Explore the Estate</a></h2>
            <p>An illustrated map of the grounds — the Rose Garden, the Hidden Ballroom, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2><a href="{{ '/gallery/' | url }}">Estate Gallery</a></h2>
            <p>Portraits, everyday moments, and scenes from every tale.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2><a href="{{ '/ai-adventure/' | url }}">Creating Your Own Noodles Adventure with AI</a></h2>
            <p>A beginner's guide to making your own plush-character stories, with real prompts.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>
